eam/apps/3521410/extras/0f9ea52eb2194935d90d0c70f347013b.poster.avif?t=1770863711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521410/extras/0f9ea52eb2194935d90d0c70f347013b.webm?t=1770863711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521410/extras/0f9ea52eb2194935d90d0c70f347013b.mp4?t=1770863711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to pour some purrfection?</h2>Put on your apron, warm up the espresso machine, and make your café the cat’s meow. Whether you’re in it for the stories, the drinks, or the fluffy friendships, *Cats &amp; Cups* is your next cozy escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521410/extras/1f588afc06fc65ceb254f0e366f81291.avif?t=1770863711\" width=1560 height=460 /></span>",
